  #line-at(108.02pt, 428.83pt, "The observed channel charge depletion was explored using a simple one-dimensional ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 456.43pt, "electrostatics model. By treating the Si-doped channel and N-doped layer junction as a metal-")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 484.03pt, "semiconductor junction with the Fermi level pinned at the acceptor level in the N-doped layer, ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 511.63pt, "the depletion width from the N-doped substrate into the Si-doped channel can be calculated. The ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 539.23pt, "depletion width obtained using this model was 72 nm, which showed that there was significant ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 566.83pt, "back-depletion from the N-doped layer into the Si-doped channel, decreasing the channel charge. ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 594.46pt, "This corroborated what was seen from integrated channel charge values from C-V measurements ")
